Important course philosophy

The course is intended for QA engineers transitioning towards SDET roles.

The slides should consistently reinforce this progression:

QA Engineer
      ↓
Automation Engineer
      ↓
SDET
      ↓
Embedded Quality Advocate

Do not imply that an SDET is simply:

«"A tester who writes automation."»

Instead reinforce that an SDET helps engineering teams:

- prevent defects;
- design testable systems;
- select appropriate testing levels;
- automate intelligently;
- understand system behaviour;
- diagnose failures;
- communicate risk;
- coach developers;
- improve engineering quality.

